IMAPAccount mailbox
Host imap.mailbox.org
Port 993
User tom@tomhoule.com
PassCmd "oo7-cli lookup --secret-only service=backup-mail credential=imap-password"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore mailbox-remote
Account mailbox

MaildirStore mailbox-local
Path ~/Mail/tom@tomhoule.com/
Inbox ~/Mail/tom@tomhoule.com/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mailbox-backup
Far :mailbox-remote:
Near :mailbox-local:
Patterns * INBOX
# Retry skipped/failed messages, without propagating flags or deletions.
Sync Pull New Old
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *
